  "acceptedVisualFindings": [
    "The original cramped2318 column is corrected: task words are readable beside per-item Remove in the final360px and360x420 views.",
    "Actual My Tasks/My Week/Bakery Orders source titles and running/last-checked/failed state labels remain readable in their own existing Software window.",
    "Stop running app, Check app status, Reload app view and Focus app view occupy an opaque toolbar; viewed content does not show through or overlap it.",
    "Short views intentionally show a subset of the embedded page at a time. Header Close and toolbar remain visible; the Back-to-controls capture exposes Focus and identity/history access.",
    "Counter captures preserve exact heading, labelled Count, large Increment/Reset, visible Reset keyboard focus and action feedback.",
    "Unconfirmed Start/Stop clearly call for explicit status inspection. Occupied-origin failure is visibly failed with retained-data language and available Start/Check controls.",
    "The runtime-identity disclosure explicitly qualifies the preview as the checked counter/task-list page from its accepted ZIP, with other apps using manual instructions."
